OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening and overnight for
OL,7,FShetland with some clear spells.
OL,8,FMostly dry for Orkney with some clear
OL,9,Fspells but also the odd light shower
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FRain soon reaching Orkney in
OL,13,Fthe morning, turning drier from the
OL,14,Fsouthwest in the afternoon. Dry start
OL,15,FShetland, but rain developing in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Strengthening southwesterly
OL,17,Fwinds later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
